x86_64-windows  the Microsoft tables cxx1 writes mark no funclet as terminating, so the throw from the catch's copy unwinds like a fresh exception and the outer handler catches 9 where the standard says terminate; the Itanium targets and the C6000 have the region over the copy (a catch-all row whose pad calls std::terminate, and cl6x's catch-and-terminate scope), and this case measures those.
